scenarios.prompt:
Can you review these React component tests and tell me if there are any quality issues? Here's one of our test files:

test('handleSubmit calls api with correct params', () => {
  const wrapper = shallow(<LoginForm />);
  wrapper.instance().state.username = 'testuser';
  wrapper.instance().state.password = 'testpass';
  wrapper.instance().handleSubmit();
  expect(wrapper.instance().apiService.post).toHaveBeenCalledWith('/login', { username: 'testuser', password: 'testpass' });
});

We want to make sure our tests are following best practices.
